Summary
=======

Problem:
Attackers could send fake ARP replies and redirect traffic through their systems.

Solution:
Dynamic ARP Inspection validates ARP packets using the DHCP Snooping Binding Table.

Benefit:
Prevents ARP Spoofing and Man-in-the-Middle attacks.

Limitation:
Attackers may still use unauthorized IP addresses.

